cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "proofrecord-aar-interop: signed ProofRecord and Agent Action Receipts (AAR) interoperability demonstration"
version: "0.1.0-rc.5"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Hone"
    given-names: "Derek"
    affiliation: "Remnant Fieldworks Inc."
abstract: >-
  Synthetic, offline-verifiable demonstration that an Agent Action Receipts (AAR)
  bundle cites an Ed25519-signed ExecutionProof ProofRecord and records exactly
  the action that record authorized. Includes an offline verifier, positive and
  negative fixtures, 97 targeted tests and a reproducible observation of AAR-
  conformant bundles that disagree with the ProofRecord. Same-author results;
  not independent validation; not formal AAR conformance.
keywords:
  - ExecutionProof
  - ProofRecord
  - Agent Action Receipts
  - pre-execution authorization
  - Ed25519
  - interoperability
  - offline verification
  - AI agent accountability
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Agent Action Receipts (AAR)"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/oneshot2001/aar"
    commit: "aab2feca93986f92f29f7672dff3464e05163cb5"
